name: Erratic Five Spike — many 5s
author: corpus
description: >-
  Erratic Deck starting deck with at least 13 Fives, a 25% rank spike for Hack,
  Fibonacci, Odd Todd, and X-of-a-kind hands. RAG aliases: erratic fives, many 5s,
  low-card pile, Fibonacci seed, five-of-a-kind start.
deck: Erratic
stake: White
must:
  - erraticRank: Five
    min: 13
should:
  - joker: Hack
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 50
  - joker: Fibonacci
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 40
  - joker: OddTodd
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 35
  - joker: TheFamily
    label: "Four/Five of a Kind payoff from Five density"
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 30
